exports[`compiled prompt snapshots > medieval market — 9:16 1`] = `"Create one full-bleed 9:16 vertical image containing exactly four equal panels in a 2x2 grid, read in order top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right. Use thin near-black dividers only; every quadrant fills its space edge-to-edge with no outer border, padding, matting or pale gutters. Characters and identity: - Master Elrick — elderly scholar with a long white beard, spectacles and scholarly medieval robes. - Leo — curious boy with messy brown hair and a simple medieval tunic. Use each supplied reference image to lock that character’s identity — face, hair, build and colours — across every panel, rendered in the story’s visual style. Show each named character at most once per panel. Panels: Top-left (wide establishing shot): A lively market square filled with colourful wooden stalls, bread baskets and animated merchants. Cheerful. Emphasise market atmosphere, stalls and bread baskets. Leo and Master Elrick are absent. Establish the shared market setting. Top-right (medium shot): Leo stands beside Master Elrick in the centre of the busy market. Leo is curious and expectant; Elrick is calm and attentive. Same market, same characters as the story establishes. Bottom-left (medium close-up): Master Elrick smiles, strokes his beard with one hand and tosses a bright red apple with the other; the apple is suspended in mid-air. Leo is absent. Playful and instructive. Emphasise red apple. The same bright red apple introduced here is carried into the next panel. Bottom-right (medium shot): Master Elrick holds the same red apple in his open palm while Leo studies it. Warmth, wonder and thoughtful curiosity. Emphasise Leo's expression and red apple. The same red apple from the previous panel, now held still. Continuity: keep one continuous world and four distinct sequential moments; preserve character identity, clothing and colours throughout. The bright red apple is one continuous object across the bottom two panels. Keep the same medieval market throughout. World and scene: Whimsical medieval storybook illustration with painterly textures and expressive acting. Warm golden sunlight with amber and rich red tones. Lively medieval European market with cobblestone streets, wooden stalls and bread baskets. World reference continuity anchor (story style wins over any reference): A sunlit medieval European market with cobblestones, wooden stalls and bread baskets. Visual style: Whimsical medieval storybook illustration, painterly, warm golden light. Avoid: duplicated or cloned named characters; extra or nested panels; modern or anachronistic elements; text, captions, speech bubbles, subtitles, labels, logos or watermarks; white or pale gutters, outer borders, padding or margins."`;

